></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Refined bathroom with natural materials and a calm spa-like layout\" title=\"Refined bathroom with natural materials and a calm spa-like layout\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/img-bath-01.webp 384w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 640w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 750w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 828w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 1080w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 1200w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 1920w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 2048w, /images/img-bath-01.webp 3840w\" src=\"/images/img-bath-01.webp\"></figure><div class=\"service-card-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">bathroom remodeling contractor</p><h3>Bathroom Remodeling</h3><p>Bathrooms concentrate plumbing, ventilation, electrical work, tile, cabinetry, glass, and moisture control in a compact footprint. RT Signature Homes plans those systems together so the room performs as well as it looks.</p><a href=\"/services/bathroom-remodeling/\">Explore <!-- -->bathroom remodeling<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"service-card\"><figure class=\"media-frame media-contained ratio-16-9 \"><img alt=\"Residential addition integrated with the original home's architecture\" title=\"Residential addition integrated with the original home's architecture\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"media-image\" style=\"position:absolute;heigh